window.EN={"1":"Lord Ced, are the children safe?","2":"I think they'll only be sent to the capital after many more have been gathered.","3":"It's all right, Asbel. We're still in time.","4":"Thank goodness. Let's rescue them quickly and return them to their mothers.","5":"Yes. But there are many guards, too. Don't let your guard down.","6":"Yes.","7":"Once we've rescued the children, Asbel, look for Prince Leif together with Brighton.","8":"What? ...Prince Leif!?","9":"Yes. It seems he fell into Raydrik's trap and was sent to this castle.","10":"...What's wrong, Asbel? You seem quite surprised.","11":"Lord Leif is a very important person to me.","12":"After we parted in the city of Tahra, I kept traveling, searching for Lord Leif the whole time.","13":"It's been three years already...","14":"So that's how it was...","15":"Then find the prince and escape Munster with him.","16":"I intend to evacuate the members of the Magi Squad outside the castle as well.","17":"As things stand, we'd only be waiting to be wiped out.","18":"Then what will you do, Lord Ced?","19":"I intend to stay in Munster a while longer.","20":"I must protect the citizens who are left.","21":"I'm sorry. You taught me so much, and I couldn't be of any use...","22":"Don't worry about that. All I taught you was that Grafcalibur.","23":"From now on, use it for Prince Leif's sake.","24":"...Lord Ced, we'll meet again, won't we?","25":"If Prince Leif is a true hero, Thracia will be liberated someday.","26":"...We'll meet again. Here in Munster.","27":"In Munster... Yes. In Munster, for sure!","28":"Sniff, sniff...","29":"Stop crying already...","30":"But... sniff...","31":"The soldiers will get mad at us again. \"You're noisy,\" they'll say...","32":"I don't care if they get mad!","33":"If they get mad and hate me, maybe they'll let me go home...","34":"I want to go home...","35":"Lord Leif!! I've finally found you! It's me, Asbel!!","36":"Asbel!? ...Why are you in a place like this? Weren't you in Tahra?","37":"After you left the city, Lord Leif, I went after you right away.","38":"But I didn't know where you'd gone, and I've been in this town since half a year ago...","39":"Right away!? ...Then, ever since three years ago...","40":"Yes. Because we promised, didn't we?","41":"That we'd join forces and take back Thracia.","42":"And yet you left me behind all alone. That's cruel, Lord Leif.","43":"I'm sorry... But there was no other way back then.","44":"Tahra was surrounded by the imperial army, and I had already resigned myself to dying.","45":"I never thought I'd be able to escape.","46":"So I didn't want to drag you into it, Asbel.","47":"Don't say that... We swore to share life and death, didn't we?","48":"Or was that oath just a game between children?","49":"I still remember it. I decided I would be your strength, Lord Leif.","50":"Asbel...","51":"Lord Leif, please take back Thracia. For that, I'll endure any hardship!","52":"Lord Ced!! Ahh, it really is Lord Ced!","53":"Hm? Isn't that Karin...?","54":"What's going on? Did you leave the country?","55":"Yes! To look for you, Prince!","56":"To look for me? ...Did Fee ask you to? Or was it Mother...","57":"...... Lord Ced, I have to tell you something important.","58":"What is it? Tell me.","59":"The truth is... Ahh... ......","60":"Karin, if you have something to say, say it clearly. I can't understand if you only cry!","61":"Yes... The truth is, the Queen...","62":"Mother!? I-it can't be...!","63":"Yes... Two months ago already...","64":"Mother... Mother has passed away...","65":"Lord Ced...","66":"So I wasn't in time... I wanted to let her see Father... even just once...","67":"Lord Ced, please return to Silesse. Lady Fee is waiting.","68":"Fee... How is she? Is she well?","69":"In front of everyone she tries desperately not to cry, but when she's alone with me, she cries until her tears run dry...","70":"You're too cruel, Lord Ced. Pushing everything onto young Lady Fee, while you yourself are in a place like this...","71":"As the prince who inherited Forseti, it's only natural you'd be called a hero.","72":"But to get full of yourself over that and neglect your mother and sister,","73":"can you call yourself the prince of Silesse!?","74":"Karin... You're certainly right.","75":"But only Father could cure Mother's illness,","76":"and even if I had been at her side, there was not a single thing I could have done.","77":"Only watch Mother grow weaker... That's why... I wanted to find Father no matter what.","78":"Then why Munster?","79":"Father was in Munster until half a year ago. I came as soon as I heard the rumor, but he had already departed.","80":"But the people of this town were so pitiful that I couldn't abandon them.","81":"So that's how it was... I'm sorry for saying such terrible things...","82":"Karin, I'm sorry, but could you give me just a little more time?","83":"Once I've driven Raydrik out of this town, I'll return to Silesse.","84":"It won't take that long. At least another half a year...","85":"Then I'll stay in this town with you, Lord Ced.","86":"Karin, I'm glad for the thought, but I can't fight with you here. Go back home.","87":"...You're right. Far from being useful to you, I'd only be a burden...","88":"All right. I'll go back home.","89":"Lord Ced, you will come back to Silesse, won't you? For sure... It's a promise.","90":"Yes, I promise. As a token of it, I'll give this to you, Karin.","91":"What is it? This worn old scrap of cloth...?","92":"This is a treasure of the Silessean royal family.","93":"It's an ancient manuscript said to have been written by the Crusader Ced, and a mysterious power is hidden in it.","94":"It's really something to be given when welcoming a queen, but I'll leave it in your keeping, Karin.","95":"Something so precious, to me? I-I couldn't possibly!","96":"Karin... I'm sorry about Mother.","97":"I'm also grateful that you helped Fee.","98":"This is how I feel. I want you to accept it.","99":"...All right. But I'm only keeping it for you.","100":"When you return to Silesse, I'll be sure to give it back!","101":"Karin, let's meet again in Silesse. Stay well until then.","102":"Yes! Please stay well too, Lord Ced!","103":"Huh, I can go back to my dad?","104":"I know. I just have to escape through the corridor on the right. Thank you!","105":"I want to go home quick... Sniff, sniff. How do I get home?","106":"Okay, by the path on the right... Then I'll do that... sniff... Thank you..."};
